    category: "Windows",
    title: "Redmond 宣布 2026 年 10 月將移除大量微軟產品支援，用戶需提前規劃遷移",
    summary: "根據報導，微軟（Microsoft）預計在 2026 年 10 月將大規模淘汰或停止支援多款產品。這項行動對依賴這些舊版或特定產品線的企業和開發者構成重大影響。雖然原文未提供具體的受影響產品清單或技術細節，但其實務影響在於，用戶必須提前規劃系統升級和遷移路徑，以避免在支援終止後遭遇功能失效或安全風險。建議用戶應密切關注微軟官方發布的產品生命週期管理（PLM）公告，並根據其時間表，儘早將核心業務系統升級至支援最新的版本，以確保業務的連續性和安全性。",
    tags: ["Microsoft", "產品支援終止", "2026年10月", "系統升級", "企業IT"],
    title_en: "Redmond Announces Removal of Support for Numerous Microsoft Products in October 2026; Users Must Plan Migration in Advance",
    summary_en: "According to reports, Microsoft is expected to phase out or cease support for multiple products on a large scale in October 2026. This action poses a significant impact on enterprises and developers who rely on these older or specific product lines. Although the original text does not provide a specific list of affected products or technical details, the practical implication is that users must plan system upgrades and migration paths in advance to avoid functional failure or security risks after support ends. Users are advised to closely monitor Microsoft's official Product Lifecycle Management (PLM) announcements and upgrade core business systems to supported, latest versions according to the timeline, to ensure business continuity and security.",
