    title: "Anthropic Claude Code Mac App新增功能：支援在互動模擬器中測試iOS應用程式",
    summary: "Anthropic宣布在Claude Code Desktop的公開測試版中加入新功能，允許用戶在Mac設備上直接在互動模擬器面板中建構、啟動和測試iOS應用程式。此功能適用於使用Pro、Max和Team方案的用戶，且需要安裝了iOS平台的Xcode。該功能讓Claude能夠在模擬器中運行應用，並與其介面進行互動，用戶可以實時觀察並迭代修改。Anthropic強調，由於iOS模擬器只能在macOS上運行，此功能為Mac專用。使用時，Claude會透過模擬器面板驅動模擬器，不會佔用電腦資源或遮擋其他視窗。需要注意的是，此功能僅限於本地會話（local sessions），雲端或SSH會話無法存取用戶的Mac模擬器。這大幅提升了AI輔助開發的實用性，讓開發者可以在一個環境內完成代碼生成、運行和測試的完整循環。",
    tags: ["Anthropic", "Claude Code", "iOS", "macOS", "Xcode", "模擬器", "開發工具"],
    title_en: "Anthropic Claude Code Mac App Adds Feature: Supports Testing iOS Applications in Interactive Simulator",
    summary_en: "Anthropic announced a new feature in the public beta of Claude Code Desktop, allowing users to build, run, and test iOS applications directly within the interactive simulator panel on Mac devices. This feature is available to users with Pro, Max, and Team plans and requires the installation of Xcode for the iOS platform. This capability enables Claude to run and interact with applications in the simulator, allowing users to observe and iterate modifications in real-time. Anthropic emphasizes that because the iOS simulator can only run on macOS, this feature is Mac-exclusive. When used, Claude drives the simulator through the panel, without consuming computer resources or obscuring other windows. It is important to note that this feature is limited to local sessions; cloud or SSH sessions cannot access the user's Mac simulator. This significantly enhances the practicality of AI-assisted development, allowing developers to complete the full cycle of code generation, execution, and testing within a single environment.",
