    id: "20260722-023",
    trackers: ["os", "security"],
    category: "漏洞與威脅情報",
    title: "假冒巴林緊急警報App：駭客利用恐慌情緒散播四階段安卓監控惡意軟體",
    summary: "資安廠商 Dream 揭露一波新型威脅活動，駭客利用用戶對政府緊急警報通知的信任，偽造名為「BH Alert」的安卓應用程式。該應用程式偽裝成巴林民防或內政部官方警報工具，透過模仿 Google Play 商店和政府網站的假網頁進行散播。一旦用戶安裝並開啟，惡意軟體將啟動四階段監控平台，能夠竊取鎖屏密碼、簡訊和一次性密碼、聯絡人、截圖，並運行銀行App疊層，甚至實現設備的遠端完全控制。攻擊者散播此類應用程式的時機，往往與國家級危機（如伊朗飛彈襲擊）相關，利用用戶在恐慌狀態下降低警惕性。防禦建議包括：企業應利用行動裝置管理（MDM）來強制執行政策、阻止側載安裝，並結合強化網路監控，因為惡意軟體會產生規律的「心跳」流量，可供網路監控系統偵測。",
    tags: ["Android 惡意軟體", "BH Alert", "監控軟體", "政府欺騙", "MDM", "網路監控"],
    title_en: "Fake Bahrain Emergency Alert App: Hackers Exploit Panic to Spread Four-Stage Android Surveillance Malware",
    summary_en: "Security vendor Dream has revealed a new wave of threat activity where hackers exploit users' trust in government emergency alert notifications by fabricating an Android application named \"BH Alert.\" This application disguises itself as an official alert tool from the Bahrain Civil Defense or Ministry of Interior, spreading through fake webpages that mimic the Google Play Store and government websites. Once installed and opened, the malware activates a four-stage surveillance platform capable of stealing screen lock passwords, SMS and one-time passwords, contacts, and screenshots, running overlays on banking apps, and even achieving full remote device control. Attackers often disseminate such applications coinciding with national-level crises (such as Iranian missile strikes), leveraging users' reduced vigilance during states of panic. Defensive recommendations include: enterprises should utilize Mobile Device Management (MDM) to enforce policies, block sideloaded installations, and combine this with enhanced network monitoring, as the malware generates regular \"heartbeat\" traffic that can be detected by network monitoring systems.",
    tags_en: ["Android Malware", "BH Alert", "Surveillance Software", "Government Deception", "MDM", "Network Monitoring"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Dark Reading", url: "https://darkreading.com/mobile-security/fake-bahrain-alert-apps-android-surveillance-malware", lang: "EN" }
    ]
