    category: "Apple",
    title: "Apple Store App 將整合 AI 虛擬購物助理，強化用戶數據收集與個人化體驗",
    summary: "Apple 更新了 Apple Store 應用程式的隱私權政策，預告將推出「虛擬購物助理」（Virtual Shopping Assistant）。此功能將允許應用程式收集和儲存用戶的帳戶資訊、設備識別碼、聊天內容及位置數據，以提供個人化聊天體驗和相關建議。Apple 表示，在與合作夥伴分享聊天內容前，會移除個人識別資訊。這暗示虛擬助理的響應可能來自外部第三方模型。用戶可以透過「帳戶 > 設定」中的「聊天改進」（Chat Improvements）選項，選擇是否同意使用對話紀錄來改進虛擬助理。此外，Apple 也將保留這些對話紀錄用於業務分析。此舉延續了 Apple 在零售領域導入 AI 的趨勢，此前已在銷售教練 App 和 Genius Bar 服務中測試 AI 應用，顯示 Apple 正積極利用 AI 提升零售體驗與數據分析能力。",
    tags: ["Apple Store", "AI", "虛擬購物助理", "隱私權政策", "數據收集", "macOS"],
    title_en: "Apple Store App to Integrate AI Virtual Shopping Assistant, Enhancing User Data Collection and Personalization",
    summary_en: "Apple has updated the Apple Store app's privacy policy, announcing the launch of a \"Virtual Shopping Assistant.\" This feature will allow the application to collect and store user account information, device identifiers, chat content, and location data to provide personalized chat experiences and relevant suggestions. Apple stated that it will remove personally identifiable information before sharing chat content with partners. This suggests that the virtual assistant's responses may originate from external third-party models. Users can opt-in to using their conversation history for virtual assistant improvements via the \"Chat Improvements\" option under \"Account > Settings.\" Furthermore, Apple will retain this conversation history for business analysis. This move continues Apple's trend of introducing AI into the retail sector, following previous tests of AI applications in the Sales Coach App and Genius Bar services, indicating that Apple is actively leveraging AI to enhance retail experience and data analysis capabilities.",
    tags_en: ["Apple Store", "AI", "Virtual Shopping Assistant", "Privacy Policy", "Data Collection", "macOS"],
    sources: [
      { name: "9to5Mac", url: "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/22/apple-store-app-may-soon-get-an-ai-powered-shopping-assistant", lang: "EN" }
    ]
