    title: "iOS 27 重磅升級 CarPlay：整合進階 Siri AI、專用影音應用與全新設計介面",
    summary: "Apple 在 iOS 27 版本中為 CarPlay 帶來多項重大升級。最大的亮點是整合了全新的「Siri AI」功能，使其具備更強大的問答能力，能媲美 ChatGPT 或 Google Gemini，並能更好地維持對話上下文。此外，開發者現在可以為 CarPlay 創建專用的影音應用，讓用戶可以直接在車載螢幕上瀏覽和播放影片，而不僅限於 AirPlay 串流。在設計層面，iOS 27 的新壁紙和 Liquid Glass 風格的 App 圖示也延伸至 CarPlay。媒體應用新增了 MiniPlayer，並允許用戶在 Now Playing 畫面使用更大的進度指示器進行音訊快轉（audio scrubbing）。這些更新旨在提升車載娛樂體驗，但開發者需注意，車廠仍需簽署才能支援這些新功能。",
    tags: ["iOS 27", "CarPlay", "Siri AI", "Apple", "macOS", "Liquid Glass"],
    title_en: "iOS 27 Major CarPlay Upgrade: Integrating Advanced Siri AI, Dedicated Media Apps, and New Design Interface",
    summary_en: "Apple is bringing multiple major upgrades to CarPlay in iOS 27. The biggest highlight is the integration of the new \"Siri AI\" feature, which boasts more powerful Q&A capabilities, comparable to ChatGPT or Google Gemini, and can better maintain conversational context. Furthermore, developers can now create dedicated media applications for CarPlay, allowing users to browse and play videos directly on the car screen, rather than being limited to AirPlay streaming. In terms of design, iOS 27's new wallpapers and Liquid Glass style app icons also extend to CarPlay. The media app has added a MiniPlayer, and users can now perform audio scrubbing with a larger progress indicator on the Now Playing screen. These updates aim to enhance the in-car entertainment experience, but developers should note that car manufacturers must still sign off to support these new features.",
    tags_en: ["iOS 27", "CarPlay", "Siri AI", "Apple", "macOS", "Liquid Glass"],
    sources: [
      { name: "9to5Mac", url: "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/22/heres-everything-new-for-carplay-in-ios-27", lang: "EN" }
    ]
