    title: "三星 Galaxy Z Fold8 上市後，開發者需重考適應式佈局架構，應優化超寬螢幕與多態式裝置體驗",
    summary: "隨著三星在 Galaxy Unpacked 2026 上發表 Z Fold8 等新型折疊與穿戴裝置，應用程式的開發者必須應對日益多樣化的螢幕尺寸、比例和使用情境。特別是 Z Fold8 採用了超寬螢幕（ultra-wide display）設計，使得傳統的硬編碼佈局規則難以應對。文章強調，開發者應將佈局架構設計為流動且適應性強（fluid, adaptive），應優先考慮「視窗類別寬度」（window class width）來決定佈局，再根據高度進行調整。此外，建議利用 Jetpack Window Manager 函式庫和「視窗大小類別」（Window Size Classes）來精確追蹤應用程式實際佔用的顯示空間，以確保在多視窗、分屏或多工處理狀態下，UI 仍能流暢地適應變化。開發者應關注採用 Jetpack Compose 的最新版本進行佈局管理。",
    tags: ["Android", "Samsung", "Galaxy Z Fold8", "Jetpack Compose", "適應式佈局", "超寬螢幕"],
    title_en: "Following the Launch of the Samsung Galaxy Z Fold8, Developers Must Rethink Adaptive Layout Architectures and Optimize for Ultra-Wide and Multi-Modal Device Experiences",
    summary_en: "With Samsung's unveiling of new foldable and wearable devices like the Z Fold8 at Galaxy Unpacked 2026, application developers must address increasingly diverse screen sizes, aspect ratios, and usage scenarios. The Z Fold8, in particular, features an ultra-wide display design, making traditional hardcoded layout rules difficult to manage. The article emphasizes that developers should design layout architectures to be fluid and highly adaptive, prioritizing the 'window class width' to determine the layout, and then adjusting based on height. Furthermore, it recommends utilizing the Jetpack Window Manager library and 'Window Size Classes' to accurately track the application's actual occupied display space, ensuring the UI remains smoothly adaptive in multi-window, split-screen, or multitasking states. Developers should pay attention to using the latest version of Jetpack Compose for layout management.",
    tags_en: ["Android", "Samsung", "Galaxy Z Fold8", "Jetpack Compose", "Adaptive Layout", "Ultra-wide Display"],
