    title: "Adobe Acrobat PDF工具整合至WhatsApp Web，讓用戶無需離開聊天介面即可檢視與批註文件",
    summary: "Adobe 宣布將其 Acrobat PDF 工具直接整合至 WhatsApp Web 和 Windows 版 WhatsApp 應用程式。此功能讓用戶可以直接在聊天介面內開啟、檢視和批註 PDF 文件，無需手動下載或離開對話視窗。此整合不僅支援標準 PDF，還包含密碼保護文件，且文件內容仍受 WhatsApp 端對端加密保護，確保只有聊天群組成員可以閱讀。Adobe 表示，此舉反映了 WhatsApp 在大型螢幕上用於審閱合約、發票和表格的日益增長使用趨勢，並符合其將 Acrobat PDF 工具帶到 Chrome、Microsoft 360、Copilot 和 ChatGPT 等多個工作平台的整體策略。",
    tags: ["Adobe Acrobat", "WhatsApp Web", "PDF", "端對端加密", "跨平台整合", "文件管理"],
    title_en: "Adobe Acrobat PDF tools integrated into WhatsApp Web, allowing users to view and annotate documents without leaving the chat interface",
    summary_en: "Adobe announced the direct integration of its Acrobat PDF tools into WhatsApp Web and the Windows WhatsApp application. This feature allows users to open, view, and annotate PDF files directly within the chat interface, eliminating the need for manual downloads or leaving the conversation window. This integration not only supports standard PDFs but also includes password-protected documents, and the file content remains protected by WhatsApp's end-to-end encryption, ensuring that only group members can read it. Adobe stated that this move reflects the growing trend of using WhatsApp on large screens for reviewing contracts, invoices, and forms, aligning with its overall strategy of bringing the Acrobat PDF tool to multiple platforms such as Chrome, Microsoft 365, Copilot, and ChatGPT.",
