    summary_en: "The European Commission will hold an online launch event on September 14, 2026, to formally introduce three Generative AI (GenAI) pilot projects funded by the Digital Europe Programme. These three projects—'FLOODS & DROUGHTS,' 'EUNOMIA.AI,' and 'EuropAI'—aim to assist public administrations in developing, procuring, testing, and deploying GenAI solutions that comply with European legal, operational, and societal requirements. The launch of these projects underscores the EU's commitment to promoting trustworthy European generative AI solutions within the public sector. Following the meeting, an Apply AI stakeholder conference will be held to discuss the primary opportunities and challenges of applying AI in public administration, encouraging industry exchange and promoting the wider adoption of successful GenAI solutions across Europe.",
